Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 22:21:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 186/342] meson_mali: bring-up driver for the ODROID-C2's
 Mali-450 MP3

PLAN.md M43 stage 2: the core clock at 666 MHz (glitch-free when one runs),
the GPU's PMU powering its domains, the GP and PP version registers, both
L2 caches, the GP's and PPs' soft resets, the four MMUs on an empty address
space with the DLBU page at its fixed address, the DLBU and broadcast units,
and the ten interrupts, checked with the reset-completed interrupts. A
"mali" KDL command shows the registers. Jobs and lima's interface come in
stage 3. From the port's docs/m43-mali-facts.md and
docs/m43-gxbb-mali-integration-facts.md.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
